"The Forthright Building is a glass-and-steel oval classroom building at Celena North High."
"Its ground floor is half theater and lecture hall, half student coffee shop."
"Its upper floors are classrooms; its roof is an open-air gallery of student wrightwork and art."
"The eighth floor is Artonan-inspired, with abstract wood carvings and shoe cubbies at each door."
"Artonan classes on the eighth floor sit on cushions stacked by the windows."
"Preparatory Sciences, Artonan Conversation IV, Intro to Other Worlds and study hall meet here."
